ts=2026-09-08T16:06:45.773Z type=decision scope=fluxora/brand content="FLUX VORTEX v2 mark (four tapered liquid-titanium blades + champagne-gold floating orb, Black Obsidian + Champagne Gold palette) supersedes FLUX ORBIT v1. Generator is scripts/fluxora-icon.js (idempotent, zero deps) -> re-runs fully regenerate all assets. Single source of truth: src/assets/fluxora-mark*.svg; FluxoraMark.tsx renders the bundled SVG via <img> (no more hand-coded path data). ChatView EmptyState has obsidian vortex watermark. Favicon is the v2 glyph data-URI in index.html. build/icon.png + icon.ico (16-1024) feed window/taskbar/installer. Geometry verified numerically (4 blade clusters per 6-deg ring scan; orb core rgb 255,248,225). Report: BRAND_EVOLUTION_REPORT.md. KEY GOTCHA: don't set inline style width/height in FluxoraMark (className h-16 sh-16 in AboutDialog must win); use SVG width/height attributes only, classes override attributes."
ts=2026-09-08T17:55:33.066Z type=decision scope=fluxora/brand content="Fluxora reference recalibration + delivery (v2.1): mark recolor to black-chrome + champagne gold per desktop fluxora.png (0 blue pixels on icon, orb rgb 248,232,197); fonts @fontsource/sora (wordmark .fx-wordmark) + @fontsource/manrope (UI); index.css tokens re-themed gold; TitleBar/Sidebar/AboutDialog/splash/EmptyState updated. Desktop app: Fluxora.lnk -> release\\win-unpacked\\Fluxora.exe (self-contained, vortex icon); NSIS installer Fluxora-Setup-1.0.0.exe + Fluxora-Portable-1.0.0.exe in release/. CRITICAL GOTCHA: electron-builder npmRebuild wiped the sqlite3 prebuilt binary (crashed 'Could not locate bindings'); fix = npm i -D @electron/rebuild + npx electron-rebuild -f -w sqlite3 (binary at node_modules\\sqlite3\\build\\Release\\node_sqlite3.node, Electron 28 ABI). electron-builder.json has npmRebuild:false, signAndEditExecutable:false (winCodeSign 7z fails on Windows symlink privilege), per-target artifactName (Setup vs Portable). Do not re-enable npmRebuild without VS build tools."
